			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740020301,
					"content": "我们之前是不是在空中，在泡泡里向上飞来着…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020302,
					"content": "对呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020303,
					"content": "然后我们一直、一直往上飞，最后一头扎进了水里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020304,
					"content": "嗯，有什么问题吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020305,
					"content": "呃，问题太多了，一时间不知道从哪里开始说好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020306,
						740020307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020306,
					"content": "就当是水仙十字王国的神奇之处吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740020308,
					"content": "…好啦好啦，我不问就是了！按照之前的说法，莉利丝公主的「宝物」就在这附近吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020309,
					"content": "嗯。就在那边，被三重的封印守护着。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020310,
					"content": "在哪里？喔，是那个吗？虽然外面的大泡泡很大，但宝物装在很小的宝箱里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020311,
					"content": "仔细一看，大泡泡外还连着一些水流一样的东西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020312,
					"content": "看来这边的水泡阵地出于某种原因并不会攻击我们呢。嗯，就用它来解除封印吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020313,
					"content": "将它发射的泡泡，<color=#00E1FFFF>引导到那个水流连接的圆环</color>上，泡泡的破坏力就会通过水流传导过去，削弱封印的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020314,
					"content": "毕竟，那些泡泡真的很可怕呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020315,
					"content": "一、二、三…似乎<color=#00E1FFFF>有三股水流</color>，将这些都解决了，就能拿到宝物了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020316,
					"content": "#嗯！拜托你们了，{NICKNAME}骑士、派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020307,
					"content": "谁也不想被重力束缚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020308
					]
				}
			]
		},
