					"nextDialogs": [
						740021006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021006,
					"content": "#等等，「上校」。{NICKNAME}是我们管弦乐团的联络人，可不是什么杂牌军炮灰小兵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021007,
					"content": "#哈！如果你们组织容得下{NICKNAME}，那怕不是要改名叫{NICKNAME}管弦乐团才对！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯特上校"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021008,
					"content": "#哼！你上校的头衔应该让给{NICKNAME}才对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021009,
					"content": "让士兵流血，自己居功的长官常见，但「上校」您这样不但一事无成，连风头都让士兵抢走的将校，那可真是珍稀动物！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021010,
					"content": "#你…！你蹲在这里无所事事的时候，我可是把穹顶水中的水泡阵地给拿下了，{NICKNAME}{M#他们}{F#她们}才能顺利拿到宝物！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021011,
						740021014,
						740021015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯特上校"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021011,
					"content": "大家，请不要为我争吵了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021012
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021012,
					"content": "呜哇，好有女主角气势的发言！那个，要不…要不这么办吧！就叫「派蒙上校抵抗阵线」和「派蒙管弦乐团」怎么样！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021013,
					"content": "？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021016,
					"content": "啊啊，烦死了！莫里，上！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021017,
					"content": "汪汪！坏家伙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫里"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021018,
					"content": "莫里将雅克拱翻在地。\\n\\n",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021019
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021019,
					"content": "莫里将雅克拱翻在地。\\n凯特上校幸灾乐祸地笑了。\\n随后莫里转身又将凯特拱翻在地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021020,
					"content": "最后在阿尔与小卷心菜的调解下，骚动平息下来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021021
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021021,
					"content": "真是的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021022
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021022,
					"content": "莫里在这种时候很可靠呢…在某种意义上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021023
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021023,
					"content": "该干正事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021024
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021024,
					"content": "嗯！总这样也不是办法，而且，如果不继续行动，大家又会吵起来吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021025
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021025,
					"content": "#嗯…{NICKNAME}骑士、派蒙，你们说得对。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021026,
					"content": "那么，安来一段演讲吧！振奋人心的那种！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021027
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021027,
					"content": "欸？但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021028
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021028,
					"content": "我很赞同派蒙的说法。在这种时刻，冒险团的「团长」才更应该站出来，不是吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021029
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021029,
					"content": "我不擅长这种事情…而且，说我是「团长」也实在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021030
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021030,
					"content": "我以上校的名誉担保，如果水仙十字冒险团需要一个军官的话，你是最合适的人选。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021031
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯特上校"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021031,
					"content": "且不提上校的名誉一文不值，我们的看法是一致的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021032,
					"content": "#那个，我不懂什么团长、什么名誉的事情喔，不过，如果没有安、没有安带来的{NICKNAME}骑士和派蒙，现在我都不知道怎么样了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021033
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021033,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021034,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}骑士、派蒙，你们觉得呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021035,
						740021036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021035,
					"content": "这是大家的愿望。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021038,
					"content": "嗯…那，作为冒险团的团长，这时候我应该做什么呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021039
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021039,
					"content": "唔，我想想…既然我们拿到了莉利丝公主的宝物，接下来就应该进入高塔、解救莉利丝公主了，对吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021040,
					"content": "那在行动前，团长应该发表激励人心的演说！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021041
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021041,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021042
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021042,
					"content": "#派蒙，你有没有兴趣当团长？或者，{NICKNAME}骑士…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021043
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021043,
					"content": "喂！怎么能这样的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021044
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021044,
					"content": "毕竟，都是依靠你们的力量，才有这样的进展…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021045,
						740021046,
						740021047
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021045,
					"content": "归根到底，我们只是外援。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021051
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021051,
					"content": "总之，只有安才适合担任水仙十字冒险团的团长，这也是大家的愿望，你就别推辞了嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021052
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021052,
					"content": "支持！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021053
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021053,
					"content": "啊啊！团长什么的，这样一来，感觉以前很轻松的事情，现在都变得有点沉重了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021054
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021054,
					"content": "那么…咳咳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021055
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021055,
					"content": "不管组织的名字是什么，我们大家都是水仙十字冒险团的成员。我们有着一致的目的，那就是拯救莉利丝公主…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021056
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021056,
					"content": "莉利丝小姐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021057
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021057,
					"content": "…或者莉利丝小姐，并将水仙十字王国…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021058
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021058,
					"content": "共和…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021059
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021059,
					"content": "（发出威胁的低吼声。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021060
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫里"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021060,
					"content": "咳咳。安，请继续。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021061
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021061,
					"content": "…并将水仙十字王国光复，让这片土地与其中的水域，再次变得闪闪发光，让向日葵再度盛开。没有错吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021062
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021062,
					"content": "没错！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021063
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021063,
					"content": "我们在漫长的岁月中经历了许许多多的斗争与分离，当初冒险团的伙伴们有的已经不在我们的身边。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021064
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021064,
					"content": "但我永远不会忘记一同度过的时光。我们永远都是朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021065
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021065,
					"content": "…对啊，我明白了。尽管我现在是水仙十字冒险团的团长，但在作为大家的团长之前，我首先应该是大家的朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021066
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021066,
					"content": "凯特上校、雅克，你们也一样。不要因为信念和立场的区别，就忘记友谊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021067
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021067,
					"content": "（安说出了很成熟的话呢！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021068,
						740021071
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021068,
					"content": "好！（鼓掌）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021069
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021069,
					"content": "好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021070
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021070,
					"content": "真是的，别捉弄我啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021072
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021072,
					"content": "#这次，借助{NICKNAME}骑士与派蒙的力量，我们终于取得了莉利丝公主的宝物。尘封的时间将再度流逝，我们将拯救莉利丝公主。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021073
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021073,
					"content": "#正直又厉害的{NICKNAME}骑士、派蒙，谢谢你们，你们永远都会是我们的朋友。我相信，莉利丝公主也会很高兴地将你们视为朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021074
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021074,
					"content": "好、好了，讲完了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021075
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021075,
					"content": "好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021076,
						740021078
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021076,
					"content": "好！（鼓掌）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021077
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021077,
					"content": "好！那么，接下来…我们应该怎么做呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021079
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021079,
					"content": "这个嘛…我想想，这时候应该向停滞的高塔，释放宝物中的力量。这样一来，「时间」就会再度开始流逝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021080
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021080,
					"content": "像这样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021081
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021081,
					"content": "哇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021082
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021082,
					"content": "#由衷感谢你，{NICKNAME}骑士。这样一来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021083
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021083,
					"content": "很遗憾，接下来会发生什么事情，恐怕我{RUBY#[D]水仙十字冒险团}们谁也不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021084
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021084,
					"content": "但是，既然现在公主的高塔封印已经解除，我们要尽快行动才行，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021085
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021085,
					"content": "嗯，小卷心菜说得对。我们走吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021078,
					"content": "接下来应该怎么做？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021079
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021071,
					"content": "（很不容易呢。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021072
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021046,
					"content": "举手之劳而已，我就不僭越了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021051
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021047,
					"content": "那我就会变成「骑士团长」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021048
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021048,
					"content": "听起来好累，还是算了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021049
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021049,
					"content": "#如果有一天，{NICKNAME}变成了骑士团长，记得要让我当荣誉骑士喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021050
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021050,
					"content": "荣誉骑士派蒙，听起来很响亮呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021051
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021036,
					"content": "这是你们之间的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021037
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021037,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}的意思是，既然大家都这么说了，安你就接受吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021038
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021014,
					"content": "我听够了，再见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021016
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021015,
					"content": "首先，我没加入你们任何一方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021016
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7400213,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7400213
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7400213",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7400213,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"雅克",
					"阿尔",
					"安",
					"小卷心菜",
					"凯特上校",
					"莫里"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740021301,
					"content": "纳西索斯手下这些喽啰怎么这么多头衔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021302,
					"content": "越是没用的人，越是需要帽子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021303,
					"content": "#其实，这些都是纳西索斯手下的猛将，和我们交锋多次，也对我们造成了不少损失。但{NICKNAME}实力高强，不构成威胁。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021304,
					"content": "#抱歉喔…{NICKNAME}骑士，我们的攻击对纳西索斯的爪牙没有效果，所以只能辛苦你了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021305,
						740021306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021305,
					"content": "轻轻松松。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021307,
					"content": "唔…不过，莉利丝公主在哪儿呢？接下来好像也无路可走了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021308,
					"content": "接下来的事情，我也没想过…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021309,
					"content": "唔…那就向上吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021310,
					"content": "欸？要怎么上去？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021311,
					"content": "派蒙飞上去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021312,
					"content": "喂！就算我自己能上去…如果在上面，遇到了纳西索斯的手下怎么办！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021313,
					"content": "#就算上面都是水仙十字王国的宝藏…也要和{NICKNAME}一起，才有找到宝藏的感觉嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021314,
					"content": "向上啊…我明白了。我们或多或少也拥有一定的力量，虽说仰仗的是莉利丝公主分给我们的魔法，但也能做到一些事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021315,
					"content": "嗯…但是，这样的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021316,
					"content": "明明我们都是同源的，这种事情你应当最容易理解、最容易接受才对。而且，过去不也经历过么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021317,
					"content": "我知道，道理我都懂。但是，对这种事情，不知道为什么，我就是很讨厌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021318,
					"content": "别露出这样的表情嘛，安。我们原本是同样的一团水，不分彼此，只是为了陪伴…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021319,
					"content": "为了陪伴公主，所以用薄薄的膜将自己包裹，化成了不同的身形。那为了公主，我们再度聚合在一起，也没什么奇怪的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021320,
					"content": "所以，你们在说什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021321,
					"content": "只要我们放弃形体聚合在一起，就能产生相对比较强大的魔力。这样的话，就能够把你们送上塔顶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021322,
					"content": "欸？但那样的话——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021323,
					"content": "毋须担心，朋友。我们来自同样的水体，放弃形体并不如你所想意味着死亡。纯水能化作林野百态，而这种变化并非是单向的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021324,
					"content": "嗯！就算没有一起冒险与战斗，我们也能这样一起前进！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021325,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021326,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}骑士、派蒙，你们觉得呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021327,
					"content": "这事不应由我们做主。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021328,
						740021329,
						740021330
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021328,
					"content": "只有你能决定水仙十字冒险团的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021331,
					"content": "#唔…{NICKNAME}说得对，但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021332,
					"content": "团长，请下令吧！高塔的封印已经解除，也失去了抵御纳西索斯入侵的能力！我们应当争分夺秒！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯特上校"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021333,
					"content": "…好吧。那就拜托了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021334,
					"content": "得令！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯特上校"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021335,
					"content": "#交给我们吧！安，你要跟{NICKNAME}骑士和派蒙一起，把莉利丝公主救出来喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021336,
					"content": "哼。莉利丝小姐就交给你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅克"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021337,
					"content": "那么，亲爱的小卷心菜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021338,
					"content": "…还有莫里、凯特上校，和雅克。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021339,
					"content": "嗯。拜拜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫里"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021340,
					"content": "啊，和之前在莫里的喷泉那边的，一样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021341,
					"content": "我们的力量，都来自莉利丝公主。所以，只要能下定决心，也能够再现她的力量…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021342
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021342,
					"content": "#啊啊不行！要打起精神来！{NICKNAME}骑士、派蒙，我们上去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740021329,
					"content": "只有你能决定是否应该继续前进。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021330,
					"content": "这是你的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740021306,
					"content": "勉勉强强。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740021307
					]
				}
			]
		},
